        "### 7.31. Teste de Identidade H&iacute;brida: $P = N \u0011 (q^2 - p^2) - p$\n",
        "\n",
        "Nesta an&aacute;lise, testamos se a subtra&ccedil;&atilde;o do fator linear $p$ do v&oacute;rtice quadr&aacute;tico atua como um corretor de fase para encontrar primos."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "5332b581",
        "outputId": "b1b35d28-5f59-49f7-b735-1560e9f032ce"
      },
      "source": [
        "import gmpy2\n",
        "\n",
        "def test_hybrid_identity(p_start, iterations=100):\n",
        "    p = gmpy2.next_prime(p_start)\n",
        "    results = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for _ in range(iterations):\n",
        "        q = gmpy2.next_prime(p)\n",
        "        N = p * q\n",
        "        dq = q**2 - p**2\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Hip&oacute;tese: P = N + dq - p ou P = N - dq - p\n",
        "        cand_pos = N + dq - p\n",
        "        cand_neg = N - dq - p\n",
        "\n",
        "        for label, val in [(\"pos\", cand_pos), (\"neg\", cand_neg)]:\n",
        "            if val > 1 and gmpy2.is_prime(int(val)):\n",
        "                results.append({\"p\": int(p), \"q\": int(q), \"Type\": label, \"Prime\": int(val)})\n",
        "        p = q\n",
        "\n",
        "    df_hybrid = pd.DataFrame(results)\n",
        "    print(f\"--- Resultado da Identidade H&iacute;brida (N \u0011 Δq - p) ---\")\n",
        "    if not df_hybrid.empty:\n",
        "        display(df_hybrid)\n",
        "        print(f\"Hits encontrados: {len(df_hybrid)}\")\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        print(\"Nenhum hit encontrado com o fator de corre&ccedil;&atilde;o -p.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "test_hybrid_identity(100, 100)"
