        "\n",
        "We are shifting the search to the $10^{15}$ magnitude to verify the \"Geometric Corridor\" stability. We seek to confirm:\n",
        "1. If the **19% success rate** persists.\n",
        "2. If successful hits continue to cluster around the **1.666 resonance** (2/3 attractor)."
      ]
