      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will perform a targeted scan at magnitude 10^15, iterating through prime pairs with increasing q/p ratios to map the fertility threshold of the negative polarity vector.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
